/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/assets/7a70285258e584708a7296a2a008536dec9c97750b48e5fe0eb2f8cb7761bed1.png)\n\nCalculate the area of the parallelogram in the figure." :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-2)-2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-10\\,|=10\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268928 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b4344ad-bea7-591b-9d9a-9df93765c2d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268930} {:answer/id #uuid "dd3a11c5-b8fb-5f37-b8fa-32abeabab61a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "38" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268931} {:answer/id #uuid "77086d2f-6cf5-5165-a066-3de3857f04c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268932} {:answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268933} {:answer/id #uuid "9cb8f280-d04d-5ed7-8775-e4e765364d87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268934}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 1759