of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,13\\,|=13\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268938 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c45b96d2-b645-5a9c-aa26-0c336a305d6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "33" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268940}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c45b96d2-b645-5a9c-aa26-0c336a305d6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "33" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268940} :answer-field/id #uuid "efff2605-94f6-5a4e-88c1-f83e42ea0768" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268939}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f54067a6-f53a-5656-9593-311f98e72e1a" :question/math-academy-id "q-320404" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot (-2)-5\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =2-35 \\\\  & =-33\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-33\\,|=33\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268941 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a1febe55-9388-5935-be82-8638fbfc1303" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "26" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268943}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a1febe55-9388-5935-be82-8638fbfc1303" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "26" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268943} :answer-field/id #uuid "0be4675c-ec1c-5914-a675-19ea56bb7d63" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268942}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9b66f910-5a64-5418-84e8-a9c1f64a8580" :question/math-academy-id "q-320414" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨5,-3⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨-2,-4⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-4)-(-2)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-20-6 \\\\  & =-26\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-26\\,|=26\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268944 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268946} {:answer/id #uuid "355fc3ad-9f1d-52ab-8a17-d95b52098427" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268947}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268946} :answer-field/id #uuid "08592ac8-726f-534c-84c0-8a8e8dd42c78" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268945}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f2a974ab-e642-5854-9835-4feb37d0563f" :question/math-academy-id "q-320557" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(2\\sqrt{2})\\cdot 6-a\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =12\\sqrt{2}-3a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12\\sqrt{2}-3a & =0 \\\\ -3a & =-12\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101435 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272